  "body": "LOT-056\nCloses #397\nClaim: cloud/i397\n\n**Problem.** `RehostClientTests` only used hand-written JSON; the real host answers captured in #394 (`U01`, `U02`) were not tested.\n\n**Cause.** The captures landed after the client tests.\n\n**Change.** New `RehostClientCaptureTests` (tests only, no engine change) feeds the captured files and their recorded HTTP status to `RehostClient`, reading them in place like `HFRClientTests` does (a test bundle cannot read another's resources).\n\n**Tests.**\n- `theCapturedSuccessGivesTheFullAndThumbnailURLsAndNoMedium`: U01 gives the full URL, the `.th.` mini URL, no medium URL (medium present with null fields), width/height 16 from JSON numbers.\n- `theCapturedWrongKeyAnswerSurfacesTheHostMessage`: U02 (HTTP 400) gives `.http(400, \"Invalid API key.\")`.\n\n`swift test --filter RehostClient` passes locally (20 tests); SwiftLint clean.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CEA9FKrRqhDw1zLxKx)_",
